OVERVIEW: Convert DICOM files to FHIR resources

Convert DICOM files to FHIR resources including ImagingStudy,
Patient, Practitioner, and DiagnosticReport.

USAGE: dicom-gateway dicom-to-fhir <input> [--output <output>] [--resource <resource>] [--pretty] [--verbose]

ARGUMENTS:
  <input>                 Input DICOM file

OPTIONS:
  -o, --output <output>   Output JSON file path
  -r, --resource <resource>
                          FHIR resource type: ImagingStudy, Patient,
                          Practitioner, DiagnosticReport (default: ImagingStudy)
  --pretty                Pretty-print JSON output
  -v, --verbose           Verbose output
  --version               Show the version.
  -h, --help              Show help information.

